     "content_html": "The <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">if</code> branch is taken when <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">x &gt;= 15</code>, so the <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">else</code> branch is taken when <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">x</code> is not greater than or equal to <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">15</code>."
